   "slot": "member2_opening",
   "text": "A depeg of the paired stablecoin fits this token's mechanism because it is structurally insulated by construction, meaning exposure arises only through exit venues rather than forced sales. The recomputed exit-liquidity curves show that when the paired stablecoin trades at its middle target of $0.93, the available depth is $8.1M at a price impact of 1.0%. At a deeper stress of 5.0% price impact, the curve deepens to $9.3M, while a shallower move to 0.5% yields $7.3M in liquidity.\n\nIf the paired stablecoin trades lower at $0.88, the exit liquidity drops to $6.4M at 0.5% price impact and rises to $8.2M at 5.0%. Conversely, a higher trade price of $0.97 provides $7.1M at 0.5% and $9.0M at 5.0%, demonstrating how the mechanism-state quantities shift with the paired asset's level.",
